# Records assets/demo.gif. Needs vhs and ttyd (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs).
# Run from the repo root: vhs assets/demo.tape

Output assets/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1100
Set Height 640
Set Padding 16
Set Framerate 15
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.5
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type 'opencode'
Enter
Sleep 6s
Type '/plain'
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 8s
Type 'explain how a database index makes queries faster and when it slows writes down'
Enter
Sleep 30s
